{"id":"ece6738da9dd31ad","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-countermodel.md","title":"GL Countermodel","display":"df-gl-countermodel — GL Countermodel","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-countermodel","aliases":["89-df-gl-countermodel"],"display":"df-gl-countermodel — GL Countermodel","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-countermodel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-countermodel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-countermodel — GL Countermodel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span> is a Kripke model.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}(M,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}(M,A)\\)</span> 是下述定义的二元反模型谓词，参数依次为模型与模态公式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}(M,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W,R))\\land\n\\exists w\\in W\\;(M,w\\not\\models A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}(M,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W,R))\\land\n\\exists w\\in W\\;(M,w\\not\\models A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL反模型证明非定理</li>\n<li>GL反模型是完全性证明的工具</li>\n<li>GL反模型是 GL 模型论的核心</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLFrame}$ is the predicate from [[89-df-gl-frame]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}(M,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}(M,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W,R))\\land\n\\exists w\\in W\\;(M,w\\not\\models A).","display":true}],"bytes":923,"backlinks":[{"id":"38a14eb96d8a6dd5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Counter}_{G\\!L}$ is the countermodel predicate from\n[[89-df-gl-countermodel]]."},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-241","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-countermodel]]"}],"outgoing":["c6ab46cd662b1409","ab746eb779e20ce0","9f00301866fbd6f0","56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}